sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Q as Queue
  participant G as Graph
  participant M as Models
  participant T as Tools (MCP)
  participant R as Recruiter
  participant A as ATS
  Q->>G: job(video, rubric v3)
  G->>G: intake: consent, age, dedupe
  G->>M: transcribe (fallback if confidence low)
  G->>G: guard: redact + strip injection
  par specialists
    G->>M: communication
  and
    G->>M: domain (+ KB passages)
  and
    G->>T: verify claims
  and
    G->>G: signal quality notes
  end
  G->>M: critic re-score (other model, order swapped)
  G->>G: router sets tier
  G-->>R: interrupt: scores, quotes, clips, flags
  Note over G: state checkpointed, can wait for days
  alt rerun
    R->>G: rerun + reason
    G->>M: speech-to-text, specialists, synthesizer, critic again
    G-->>R: interrupt again
  end
  R->>G: advance / hold / reject + reason (+ corrections)
  G->>A: write decision and note
